00:59:01,783 --> 00:59:09,220

1192
00:59:09,220 --> 00:59:10,960
And there's a question.

1193
00:59:10,960 --> 00:59:12,850
What are the major
additional challenges

1194
00:59:12,850 --> 00:59:16,480
of video generation compared
