1196
00:59:18,640 --> 00:59:21,980
Well, the first
problem is the time,

1197
00:59:21,980 --> 00:59:25,840
because diffusion-based image
generation models are already

1198
00:59:25,840 --> 00:59:27,140
compute intensive.

1199
00:59:27,140 --> 00:59:29,000
And then with video
generation models,

1200
00:59:29,000 --> 00:59:31,810
you have got another
dimension of temporality.

1201
00:59:31,810 --> 00:59:35,420
So they just become
more compute intensive.

1202
00:59:35,420 --> 00:59:39,250
And then you have got more
curse of dimensionality

1203
00:59:39,250 --> 00:59:41,780
to basically address.

1204
00:59:41,780 --> 00:59:45,650
And then if you are generating
more and more frames,

1205
00:59:45,650 --> 00:59:47,780
they just become more and
more compute intensive.

1206
00:59:47,780 --> 00:59:51,910
So how do you make them
more efficient is definitely

1207
00:59:51,910 --> 00:59:52,960
the need of the hour.

1208
00:59:52,960 --> 00:59:55,520
It also adds things like
