1209
00:59:55,520 --> 00:59:56,270
Yeah, exactly.

1210
00:59:56,270 --> 00:59:56,770
Yeah.

1211
00:59:56,770 --> 01:00:00,090
Another axis of
dependency to model.

1212
01:00:00,090 --> 01:00:02,410
And you are basically
doing full 3D attention,

1213
01:00:02,410 --> 01:00:04,860
which is extremely prohibitive
to even think about.

1214
01:00:04,860 --> 01:00:10,575

1215
01:00:10,575 --> 01:00:13,440
[INAUDIBLE] just have to treat
