1230
01:00:48,340 --> 01:00:50,430
[INAUDIBLE]

1231
01:00:50,430 --> 01:00:53,050

1232
01:00:53,050 --> 01:00:55,020
But there has to be a limit.

1233
01:00:55,020 --> 01:00:58,080
If you are operating
